{"product":{"id":9410589753598,"title":"RYSE Loaded Pump","body_html":"\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"standard-markdown grid-cols-1 grid [\u0026amp;\u0026gt;_*]:min-w-0 gap-3\"\u003e\u003ch2 class=\"text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.375rem] font-bold\"\u003eRYSE Loaded Pump – 25 Servings\u003c\/h2\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"standard-markdown grid-cols-1 grid [\u0026amp;\u0026gt;_*]:min-w-0 gap-3\"\u003e\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eOverview\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003eRYSE Loaded Pump is a fully stimulant-free pre-workout powder built for athletes who want clinical-dose pumps and endurance support without any caffeine or beta-alanine. Zero stimulants means it can be stacked with your existing pre-workout, taken for evening sessions, or used on its own by those who are caffeine-sensitive — making it one of the most versatile pump products in the RYSE lineup. Available in Blue Razz Slush and Orange Cream.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"standard-markdown grid-cols-1 grid [\u0026amp;\u0026gt;_*]:min-w-0 gap-3\"\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eKey Benefits\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul class=\"list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3\"\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eL-Citrulline (4.5 g per scoop)\u003c\/strong\u003e — a clinical dose of pure L-citrulline for genuine nitric oxide production, blood flow, and muscle pumps during training\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBetaine anhydrous (2.5 g)\u003c\/strong\u003e — supports power output, cellular hydration, and endurance under load\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eTaurine (1 g)\u003c\/strong\u003e — supports hydration, muscle function, and recovery\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003ePeptiPump® (200 mg)\u003c\/strong\u003e — a patented collagen peptide ingredient associated with enhanced pump and vasodilation\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eAstraGin® (50 mg)\u003c\/strong\u003e — a patented absorption enhancer to maximise uptake of key ingredients\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eZero caffeine, zero beta-alanine\u003c\/strong\u003e — no stimulants, no tingling; suitable for evening training or stacking with a stimulant pre-workout\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"standard-markdown grid-cols-1 grid [\u0026amp;\u0026gt;_*]:min-w-0 gap-3\"\u003e\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eKey Ingredients (per scoop)\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003eL-Citrulline 4.5 g | Betaine Anhydrous 2.5 g | Taurine 1 g | PeptiPump® 200 mg | AstraGin® 50 mg\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"standard-markdown grid-cols-1 grid [\u0026amp;\u0026gt;_*]:min-w-0 gap-3\"\u003e\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHow to Use\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003eMix one scoop with 10–12 oz (300–360 ml) of water 15–30 minutes before training. 25 servings per container. Can be stacked with a stimulant pre-workout for a complete pre-training stack.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"standard-markdown grid-cols-1 grid [\u0026amp;\u0026gt;_*]:min-w-0 gap-3\"\u003e\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWarnings\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003eNot intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease. Keep out of reach of children. Store in a cool, dry place. Consult a healthcare professional before use if you are pregnant, nursing, or taking medication. Ensure adequate daily fluid intake.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e","vendor":"RYSE","product_type":"PRE-WORKOUT","created_at":"2026-08-13T09:07:54+05:30","handle":"ryse-loaded-pump-25-servings","updated_at":"2026-10-18T17:23:43+05:30","published_at":"2026-09-18T20:56:26+05:30","template_suffix":"","published_scope":"global","tags":"25 Servings, Caffeine-Free, NON-STIM, Pre-Workout, Pump, RYSE, Stim-Free","variants":[{"id":48714015965438,"product_id":9410589753598,"title":"25 Servings \/ Blue Razz Slush","price":"14999.00","sku":null,"position":1,"compare_at_price":"","fulfillment_service":"manual","inventory_management":"shopify","option1":"25 Servings","option2":"Blue Razz Slush","option3":null,"created_at":"2026-08-13T09:14:45+05:30","updated_at":"2026-10-18T17:23:43+05:30","taxable":true,"barcode":null,"grams":0,"image_id":48369630871806,"weight":0.0,"weight_unit":"kg","requires_shipping":true,"quantity_rule":{"min":1,"max":null,"increment":1},"price_currency":"LKR","compare_at_price_currency":"","quantity_price_breaks":[]},{"id":48714015998206,"product_id":9410589753598,"title":"25 Servings \/ Orange Cream","price":"14999.00","sku":null,"position":2,"compare_at_price":"","fulfillment_service":"manual","inventory_management":"shopify","option1":"25 Servings","option2":"Orange Cream","option3":null,"created_at":"2026-08-13T09:14:45+05:30","updated_at":"2026-10-18T17:23:43+05:30","taxable":true,"barcode":null,"grams":0,"image_id":48369644208382,"weight":0.0,"weight_unit":"kg","requires_shipping":true,"quantity_rule":{"min":1,"max":null,"increment":1},"price_currency":"LKR","compare_at_price_currency":"","quantity_price_breaks":[]}],"options":[{"id":12012118114558,"product_id":9410589753598,"name":"Size"